# /enrich-entities

Generalizes Topwater's `/enrich-companies`. Pulls deeper, usually-paid data
on only the {{vocabulary.entityPlural}} scoring already qualified — never
on everything discovered.

---

## Before anything

Load `standards/OUTPUT-STANDARDS.md` Rule O4. Unit of reuse: the
{{vocabulary.entity}}. A qualifying {{vocabulary.entity}} with no
enrichment row yet, or one whose tier just changed into scope, is new work;
one already enriched is not redone.
